ENTIRE_PROJECT_TRAILS=1 entire trail show --json 2>&1 | python3 -c 'import sys,json
raw=sys.stdin.read()
try:
  d=json.loads(raw)
except Exception:
  print(raw[:1500]); sys.exit()
for k in ("url","status","phase","title","description","project","project_trail"):
  if k in d: print(k, "=", json.dumps(d[k])[:300])
print(sorted(d.keys()))'

